        "subject": "LU-18687 obd: cleanup kobject default groups handling",
        "message": "LU-18687 obd: cleanup kobject default groups handling\n\nWith our kobject abstraction we can simplify _get_attr_matches().\nCurrently if we drop it into a kernel tree this breaks the build.\nMake it buildable in tree and out of tree by having\n_get_attr_matches() now always walks kobj_type.default_groups[].\nWe can do this because our compat layer maps default_attrs of\nolder kernels to default_groups. \n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nChange-Id: I8779b50f861d14310796dc2e8b49c47dab9e40cc\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
